# The published plugin archive contains the source that apps compile: android/, ios/, macos/,
# linux/, windows/, cargokit/, rust/src, Cargo.toml, and Cargo.lock.
# The archive does not contain build output or files that are specific to one machine.
# Before publication, tool/sync_native.sh copies the crate into rust/.
# The source of the crate is packages/iroh_quic/rust.
#
# NOTE: For publication, a .pubignore file replaces the .gitignore file of this directory.
# Thus, this file must list all exclusions.
rust/target/
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
**/ephemeral/
**/Podfile.lock
**/xcuserdata/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
# pub.dev shows example/lib/main.dart on the Example tab and gives points for it. The archive
# contains only the Dart part of the example app, not the platform projects or the tests.
example/*
!example/lib/
!example/pubspec.yaml
!example/README.md
# Swift Package Manager: local build output and the local XCFramework of tool/build_xcframework.sh.
# The published Swift package downloads the XCFramework from the GitHub release.
**/.build/
**/.swiftpm/
darwin/iroh_flutter/Frameworks/
